<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

```
<title>Food Harvest AI</title>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
```

</head>

<body>

```
<nav class="navbar">
    <div class="logo">🍱 Food Harvest AI</div>

    <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/donate">Donate Food</a>
        <a href="/track/demo">Track Delivery</a>
    </div>
</nav>


<main class="hero">

    <section class="hero-content">

        <div class="badge">
            AI-Powered Food Redistribution
        </div>

        <h1>
            Turn Surplus Food<br>
            Into <span>Social Impact.</span>
        </h1>

        <p>
            Food Harvest AI connects surplus food from restaurants
            with nearby NGOs and enables real-time delivery tracking.
        </p>

        <div class="buttons">

            <a href="/donate" class="btn primary">
                🍲 Donate Food
            </a>

            <a href="/track/demo" class="btn secondary">
                🚚 Track Delivery
            </a>

        </div>

    </section>


    <section class="stats">

        <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-icon">🍚</div>
            <h2>125 kg</h2>
            <p>Food Rescued</p>
        </div>

        <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-icon">🤝</div>
            <h2>12</h2>
            <p>NGOs Connected</p>
        </div>

        <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-icon">🚚</div>
            <h2>86</h2>
            <p>Deliveries</p>
        </div>

    </section>


    <section class="how-it-works">

        <h2>How It Works</h2>

        <div class="steps">

            <div class="step">
                <span>1</span>
                <h3>Donate</h3>
                <p>
                    Restaurant adds available surplus food.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="step">
                <span>2</span>
                <h3>AI Match</h3>
                <p>
                    System finds the most suitable nearby NGO.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="step">
                <span>3</span>
                <h3>Deliver</h3>
                <p>
                    Delivery partner transports the food.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="step">
                <span>4</span>
                <h3>Track</h3>
                <p>
                    NGO can track the delivery in real time.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

</main>
```

</body>
</html>
